{
  "name": "CokeAI｜货源 AI 上架（队列与即时任务）",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 货源 AI 上架\n\n后台「货源状态」页点「AI 上架」时：\n\n1. app 创建 `shop_import_jobs` 任务；\n2. 如果配置了 `SHOP_IMPORT_WEBHOOK_URL=http://n8n:5678/webhook/shop-offer-autolist`，app 立刻把 `jobId` 推给本工作流；\n3. 本工作流调用 `/api/internal/shop/import-jobs/run` 生成商品草稿；\n4. 草稿只能由运营在后台审核并勾选合规确认后手动发布。\n\n另外每 2 分钟兜底清空一次排队任务，防止 webhook 丢失。\n\n`/api/internal/shop/import-jobs/run` 需要 `x-internal-secret` 头，值取自 n8n 环境变量 `INTERNAL_API_SECRET`。",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "d7a1c2e4-0f10-4c11-9b21-000000000001",
      "name": "使用说明",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "*/2 * * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "d7a1c2e4-0f10-4c11-9b21-000000000002",
      "name": "每 2 分钟兜底",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -120,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "shop-offer-autolist",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d7a1c2e4-0f10-4c11-9b21-000000000003",
      "name": "后台点击 AI 上架",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -120,
        260
      ],
      "webhookId": "shop-offer-autolist"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "d7a1c2e4-0f10-4c11-9b21-000000000006",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.headers['x-internal-secret'] }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $env.INTERNAL_API_SECRET }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d7a1c2e4-0f10-4c11-9b21-000000000007",
      "name": "校验密钥",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        60,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://app:3000/api/internal/shop/import-jobs/run",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-internal-secret",
              "value": "={{ $env.INTERNAL_API_SECRET }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\"limit\":2}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "d7a1c2e4-0f10-4c11-9b21-000000000004",
      "name": "清空排队任务",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://app:3000/api/internal/shop/import-jobs/run",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-internal-secret",
              "value": "={{ $env.INTERNAL_API_SECRET }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ jobId: $json.body && $json.body.jobId ? $json.body.jobId : undefined }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "d7a1c2e4-0f10-4c11-9b21-000000000005",
      "name": "生成这一条草稿",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        360,
        180
      ]
    }
  ],
